message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Anjo Sleep: a personal model that learns its person overnight"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kevindechang/anjo-sleep"
url: "https://sleep.anjo.nexus"
authors:
  - family-names: Chang
    given-names: Chia Wei
abstract: >-
  Per-person nightly QLoRA adapters on Muse Glimmer 30B, scored against pre-registered pass marks
  on held-out simulated people, plus MIND, a small trained predictor of what a person will do next.
  Built for the Meta Global AI Developer Hackathon, October 27 to November 4, 2026.
keywords:
  - personalization
  - LoRA
  - continual learning
  - pre-registration
  - user modeling
